### Create a supplier
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Acme Supplies",
  "phone": "+905551234567",
  "country": "Turkey",
  "address": "Istanbul, Turkey",
  "latitude": 41.0082,
  "longitude": 28.9784
}

### Get a supplier by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### List suppliers
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers?page_size=10&page_id=0
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
